{"seq":3,"slug":"cover-model","title":"掩体数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/foundations/cover-model","wordCount":1681,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"掩体数据模型\">掩体数据模型</h1><p>前一篇给了掩体的分类词汇，这一篇把那些概念压进内存：一块掩体在数据里到底是几个 float、几个标志位、存在什么结构里。数据模型定得好不好，直接决定检测能不能高效写入、AI 能不能快速查询、每帧几千次暴露评估扛不扛得住。这一篇只管「掩体是什么数据」，至于「数据从哪来」交给<a href=\"../detection/\">检测章</a>，「数据怎么用」交给<a href=\"../usage/\">使用章</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>掩体数据有两种典型的建模粒度：<strong>掩体点</strong>（cover point，一个具体的可站位）和<strong>掩体体</strong>（cover volume，一段连续可躲的边）。前者离散、便于 AI 挑选，后者连续、便于玩家在墙边自由滑动。二者常并存——体用于玩家吸附滑动，点用于 AI 采样决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[掩体几何来源] --&gt; B[掩体体 CoverVolume&lt;br/&gt;一段连续可躲边]&#10;  B --&gt; C[采样成掩体点&lt;br/&gt;沿边按间距打点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[掩体点 CoverPoint]&#10;  D --&gt; E1[位置 position]&#10;  D --&gt; E2[法线 normal]&#10;  D --&gt; E3[高度 height: 低/高]&#10;  D --&gt; E4[边角标志 left/right/top]&#10;  D --&gt; E5[质量/暴露字段]&#10;  D --&gt; E6[占据状态 occupancy]&#10;  D --&gt; F[空间索引&lt;br/&gt;网格/八叉树/KD树]\">flowchart TD\n  A[掩体几何来源] --&gt; B[掩体体 CoverVolume&lt;br/&gt;一段连续可躲边]\n  B --&gt; C[采样成掩体点&lt;br/&gt;沿边按间距打点]\n  C --&gt; D[掩体点 CoverPoint]\n  D --&gt; E1[位置 position]\n  D --&gt; E2[法线 normal]\n  D --&gt; E3[高度 height: 低/高]\n  D --&gt; E4[边角标志 left/right/top]\n  D --&gt; E5[质量/暴露字段]\n  D --&gt; E6[占据状态 occupancy]\n  D --&gt; F[空间索引&lt;br/&gt;网格/八叉树/KD树]</pre><p>下面这张表列出掩体点最常见的字段，是本篇后续小节的目录：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁写入</th>\n<th>谁读取</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>position</td>\n<td>vec3</td>\n<td>角色站立/贴靠点</td>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>吸附、AI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>normal</td>\n<td>vec3</td>\n<td>指向可躲一侧的单位向量</td>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>暴露评估、AI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>height</td>\n<td>enum/float</td>\n<td>低掩体/高掩体或数值高度</td>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>姿态、探头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cornerLeft/Right/Top</td>\n<td>bit flags</td>\n<td>各边角是否可探</td>\n<td>检测</td>\n<td>探头、IK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>quality</td>\n<td>float(缓存)</td>\n<td>相对威胁的动态质量</td>\n<td>暴露评估</td>\n<td>AI 选点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>occupant</td>\n<td>entity id/null</td>\n<td>当前占据者</td>\n<td>吸附/占据</td>\n<td>AI、防挤占</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"掩体点-离散的可站位\">掩体点：离散的可站位</h2><p>掩体点是最小的可决策单元。它的核心是三个几何量：<strong>位置</strong>（角色贴上去后站/蹲的落点）、<strong>法线</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单位向量，指向「墙的哪一边是安全的」）、<strong>高度</strong>（决定站还是蹲、上探还是角探）。</p>\n<p>法线是整个模型里最关键的一个字段，因为掩体的方向语义全靠它。约定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 指向「可躲一侧」（即角色背贴墙面时面朝的方向的反向，或直接定义为背离墙体、指向掩体保护区的向量）。有了它，「这块掩体对来自 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 方向的威胁是否有效」就退化成一个点积判断，这个判据在<a href=\"cover-archetypes\">掩体类型谱系</a>里已给出，在<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a>里会展开成完整评分。</p>\n<p>边角信息用位标志存：<code>cornerLeft</code>、<code>cornerRight</code>、<code>cornerTop</code> 各占一位，标记这个点能不能从对应边角探头。这样一个字节就能表达探头能力，探头逻辑直接读位判断可用姿态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掩体体-连续的可躲边\">掩体体：连续的可躲边</h2><p>只有离散点，玩家沿墙移动就会一格一格地跳。所以面向玩家的系统常用<strong>掩体体</strong>：把一段连续可躲的墙边表示成一条线段或多段线（polyline），带统一的法线和高度。玩家吸附到体上后，可以沿这条边平滑左右滑动，系统实时把玩家投影到边上求出当前站位。</p>\n<p>体与点的关系是「体采样成点」：沿掩体体按固定间距（比如每 1 米）打采样点，供 AI 决策使用。这样玩家享受连续滑动，AI 享受离散候选，两不耽误。一段体的两端天然就是两个边角，探头能力可由端点直接推出。</p>\n<p>用线段参数化站位很自然：设边的两端为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，玩家在边上的位置用参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 表示，则站位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(s) = A + s\\,(B - A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。滑动就是改 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，投影玩家世界坐标到边上就是求最近点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量与暴露字段\">质量与暴露字段</h2><p>数据模型里要不要存「质量」是个设计权衡。质量是<strong>相对威胁</strong>的动态量（同一点，敌人在不同方位质量不同），严格说不该固化在静态数据里。常见做法是：静态数据里只存<strong>内禀属性</strong>（高度、硬度、朝向覆盖角），运行时再结合当前威胁算出<strong>动态质量</strong>并缓存一帧。</p>\n<p>一个实用的近似暴露评分可以写成内禀防护与朝向匹配的组合。设内禀防护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（高掩体硬掩体接近 1，低软掩体偏小），威胁方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与法线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则朝向匹配项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>t</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m = \\max(0, -\\vec{n}\\cdot\\vec{t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1481em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8981em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，一个可缓存的质量近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = b \\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这只是占位式的粗算——真正的暴露还要做射线检测、多威胁聚合，完整算法在<a href=\"../usage/exposure-lof\">暴露与视线</a>。数据模型这一层只需要预留 <code>quality</code> 缓存字段和内禀防护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的存储位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占据状态与空间索引\">占据状态与空间索引</h2><p><strong>占据状态</strong>（occupancy）字段记录一个掩体点当前被谁占用（<code>occupant</code> 存实体 id，空则可用）。它防止两个 AI 挤进同一个墙角，是吸附系统的核心数据，完整的预订/释放机制见<a href=\"../detection/cover-snapping\">吸附与占据</a>。数据模型这里只需明确：占据是<strong>运行时可变</strong>字段，不属于烘焙的静态数据，通常单独存一层与静态数据分离，避免污染只读的烘焙数据。</p>\n<p><strong>空间索引</strong>决定「给定一个位置，快速找出附近所有掩体点」这个高频查询能不能扛住。掩体点动辄成千上万，线性遍历不可接受。常用结构有三种，取舍如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>构建成本</th>\n<th>查询</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀网格</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>O(1) 邻格</td>\n<td>掩体分布较均匀、世界有界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八叉树 octree</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>三维分布不均、有高低层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KD 树</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>O(log n) 最近邻</td>\n<td>静态点集、频繁最近邻查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运行时会动态增删掩体点的项目（可破坏几何），倾向用支持增量更新的均匀网格或松散八叉树；纯静态烘焙的项目可以用构建一次的 KD 树。这条与检测策略强相关，动态几何下的索引更新见<a href=\"../detection/dynamic-cover-detection\">动态掩体检测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>掩体建模有两种粒度：掩体点（离散、供 AI 采样决策）与掩体体（连续、供玩家滑动吸附），常并存，体采样成点。</li>\n<li>掩体点的核心字段是位置、法线、高度、边角位标志；法线编码方向语义，是暴露判断的基础。</li>\n<li>质量/暴露是相对威胁的动态量，静态数据只存内禀防护，运行时算出并缓存，不固化。</li>\n<li>占据状态是运行时可变字段，应与只读烘焙数据分层；空间索引（网格/八叉树/KD 树）决定邻近查询性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>这些字段的分类来源：<a href=\"cover-archetypes\">掩体类型谱系</a></li>\n<li>静态数据怎么烘焙出来：<a href=\"../detection/cover-annotation\">掩体标注 (预烘焙)</a></li>\n<li>占据字段的完整机制：<a href=\"../detection/cover-snapping\">吸附与占据</a></li>\n<li>空间索引也是导航网格的核心话题：<a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/hierarchical-pathfinding\">36_pathfinding-navigation-mesh 层级寻路</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"掩体数据模型","id":"掩体数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"掩体点：离散的可站位","id":"掩体点-离散的可站位"},{"level":2,"text":"掩体体：连续的可躲边","id":"掩体体-连续的可躲边"},{"level":2,"text":"质量与暴露字段","id":"质量与暴露字段"},{"level":2,"text":"占据状态与空间索引","id":"占据状态与空间索引"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"掩体类型谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/foundations/cover-archetypes"},"next":{"title":"掩体标注 (预烘焙)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-cover-systems/detection/cover-annotation"}}